		<title>By: Munira Love</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=1057&#038;cpage=1#comment-15316</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Munira Love]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 23 Jul 2013 22:45:06 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=1057#comment-15316</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[He knew the plants.  He knew the birds.  He called me sister, and I knew I had a brother I could depend on.  He was made to fit in the redwoods, and we were blessed to bring him  to Humboldt Camp.  There he shared his knowledge so beautifully we will never forget.  Beloved Haleem.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>He knew the plants.  He knew the birds.  He called me sister, and I knew I had a brother I could depend on.  He was made to fit in the redwoods, and we were blessed to bring him  to Humboldt Camp.  There he shared his knowledge so beautifully we will never forget.  Beloved Haleem.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
